/*
    Recorded sounds, embedded as data URIs so they load from file:// and in
    the single-file build. Generated from sfx/*.wav: downmixed to mono and
    resampled to 22.05kHz 16-bit. UI clicks are trimmed to 0.26s, piece
    placement slaps have their quiet lead-in cut (start 3ms before the
    attack) and run 0.5s, each with a short fade out. Hit impacts have their
    silent tails cut (to 10ms past the last sound above -50dB) with a 25ms
    fade, and are normalized to -1dB. They are grouped by piece: brightest for
    the weak pawn, darkest for the queen. King-hit explosions are trimmed the
    same way (tails cut at -50dB, 80ms fade, normalized to -1dB), as are the
    low-health king hits. Enemy boot steps have their lead-in cut (3ms before
    the attack), tails cut at -50dB with a 25ms fade, normalized to -1dB.
*/

